#: source/language/constructs/lookup-path.md:1
msgid "Lookup path"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/constructs/lookup-path.md:3
msgid "**Syntax**"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/constructs/lookup-path.md:5
msgid "_lookup-path_ = `<` _identifier_ \\[ `/` _identifier_ \\]... `>`"
msgstr ""

#: source/language/constructs/lookup-path.md:7
msgid ""
"A lookup path is an identifier with an optional path suffix that resolves to "
"a [path value](../../language/types.md#type-path) if the identifier matches "
"a search path entry in [`builtins.nixPath`](../../language/builtins."
"md#builtins-nixPath). The algorithm for lookup path resolution is described "
"in the documentation on [`builtins.findFile`](../../language/builtins."
"md#builtins-findFile)."
msgstr ""

